   <text>
      <body>
         <div>
            <pb facs="#facs_1" n="1" xml:id="img_0001"/>
            <fw type="page-number" facs="#facs_1_r_1" place="top">
               <l facs="#facs_1_r_1_tl_1" n="N001"/>16</l></fw>
            
            <p facs="#facs_1_r">
               <l facs="#facs_1_r_tl_1" n="N001"/> "I will not be sure but I believe that it was
               only half down. 
               <l facs="#facs_1_r_tl_2" n="N002"/> Yes, I remember how he guilled it
               up in order to swing open the 
               <l facs="#facs_1_r_tl_3" n="N003"/> window. I could not 
               find my stick and he said "never mind, 
               <l facs="#facs_1_r_tl_4" n="N004"/> my boy, I
               shall see a good deal of you now, I hope, and <del><hi style=""text_decoration: line-through;>I</hi></del><add place="above" facs="#facs_1_l" n="N001">, I</add>
               </ab> will <l
                  facs="#facs_1_r_tl_5" n="N005"/> not keep your stick until you come back to claim
               it." I left him <l facs="#facs_1_r_tl_6" n="N006"/> there, the safe open, and the
               papers made up in packets upon the <l facs="#facs_1_r_tl_7" n="N007"/> table. It was
               so late that I could not get back to <rs type="place">Blackheath</rs> as I <l
                  facs="#facs_1_r_tl_8" n="N008"/> spent the night at the <rs type="place">Anerley
                  Arms</rs> , and I knew nothing more <l facs="#facs_1_r_tl_9" n="N009"/> until I
               read of this horible affair in the morning" </p>
            <p facs="#facs_1_r_4">
               <l facs="#facs_1_r_4_tl_1" n="N001"/> "Anything more that you would like to ask, mr.
                  <rs type="person">Holmes</rs>?"<l facs="#facs_1_r_4_tl_2" n="N002"/> said <rs
                  type="person">Lestrade</rs> , whose eyebrows had gone up once or twice during <l
                  facs="#facs_1_r_4_tl_3" n="N003"/> this remarkable explanation. </p>
            <p facs="#facs_1_r_5">
               <l facs="#facs_1_r_5_tl_2" n="N001"/> "Not until I have been to <del>
                  <rs type="place">Norwood</rs>
               </del><add place="above" facs="#facs_1_l_1" n="N001">
                  <rs type="place">Blackheath</rs>
               </add>" </p>               
         </div>
